/// HealthReporter — protocol for actors that can report their own
/// supervised sub-actors' liveness and restart-loop-protection state.
///
/// The only implementor is `Watcher`. `Dashboard` is typed against this
/// protocol (not the concrete `Watcher` class) so it can power `/api/health`
/// without depending on `Watcher` directly — mirrors `EventListener`'s role
/// for `NotificationRouter`/`Monitor`.
Protocol define: HealthReporter
  /// Snapshot of this component's supervised children: for each, whether
  /// it's currently alive and how many times it's been restarted within
  /// the current crash-loop-protection window. See `Watcher>>subsystemHealth`.
  subsystemHealth -> Dictionary
